OL,3,GNEWSAUkrainian refugee missing after
OL,4,ANepal floods
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who came to the UK as a
OL,7,FUkrainian refugee is thought to have
OL,8,Fbeen caught up in devastating flooding
OL,9,Fat the Nepal-Tibet border.
OL,11,FIryna Kripak, 34, was travelling in the
OL,12,FHimalayas, working for a travel company
OL,13,Fas a photographer, and is thought to
OL,14,Fhave been near the border when the
OL,15,Fdisaster struck on 26 August, leaving
OL,16,Fmore than 1,000 dead and thousands more
OL,17,Fmissing.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
