OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAUkrainian refugee missing after
OL,4,ANepal floods
OL,5,
OL,6,FKripak's friend Sara Braker, from
OL,7,FHadlow Down near Uckfield in East
OL,8,FSussex, said she last spoke to her at
OL,9,Fabout 07:00 local time on the morning
OL,10,Fof the floods.
OL,12,F"It was all about how beautiful and
OL,13,Famazing the Himalayas were," she said.
OL,14,F"She said 'we are just coming up to the
OL,15,Fborder in about an hour.'"
